body:
Close requested only fires on closing the window, not accepting it.
```suggestion
	dlg->connect(SNAME("canceled"), callable_mp(static_cast<Node *>(dlg), &Node::queue_free));
	dlg->connect(SNAME("confirmed"), callable_mp(static_cast<Node *>(dlg), &Node::queue_free));
```

